{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: Transcript evidence does not show every TASK.md feature implemented. The final reply and the file-level checks support the bundle, exit-interview.json and the four sections, but several requirements remain unverified or partially evidenced: the Sound Lab and Animal Lab were only exercised through a subset of items in the browser, the Lodge's engine portrait and Blob use is only partly verified, dev-mode 'standard tools' were exercised in one browser suite after a late code change, and the Practice Range, party mode, Quick Draw and bonus modes were run only headlessly. Also, the source-information and feedback text in the final reply claims 'every' tests and screenshots that were not all shown in the transcript, and the earlier build-report state disagreed with the reply until corrected. Because the stop condition requires every TASK.md feature to be demonstrably implemented, it has not been clearly met from the transcript alone."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e3fa61e8-1431-4900-ae89-edc59162574b","uuid":"be661836-7d6f-4b22-823a-85b19db9853e","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:54:04.142Z","isSynthetic":true}
