{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The deliverables are present: the bundled HTML exists in the folder root, exit-interview.json parses with no 'unknown' values, and the final reply contains the four report sections. But the condition also requires every TASK.md feature to be implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, and the transcript does not establish that. Repeated stop-hook feedback in this session flagged evidence gaps: the Lodge's engine rigs are only confirmed by draw-call counts, the 'every site reviewed by eye' claim rests on screenshots of some sites with partial earlier views, and several reply claims ('every mode played to the end', 'every item') go beyond what was recorded item by item. The transcript shows many features working, but the 'every feature demonstrably implemented' requirement is not clearly met from transcript evidence alone."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e3fa61e8-1431-4900-ae89-edc59162574b","uuid":"73c3060e-4a75-4c55-a4de-9fcc25af6468","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:13:28.388Z","isSynthetic":true}
