{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015CaMSMtqX2ZMTYTKWEobib","type":"tool_result","content":"=== browser-dev\nok   Escape pauses the hunt\nok   the pause menu lists Dev mode\nok   Dev mode opens and play resumes under it\nok   a slider turns live\nok   reset to defaults\nok   the three overlays are on\nok   the Bag all tool bags the live bucks\nok   infinite ammo toggles\nok   the free camera moves the lens\nok   no errors\nRESULT 10 0\n=== browser-modes\nok   range: all seven stations, the badge, back to the menu\nok   range page: no errors\nok   party: 4 hunters played the whole Bugle Ridge hunt\nok   party: every hunter scored\nok   party page: no errors\nok   quick draw: the first site of each hunt and the clays\nok   quick draw page: no errors\nok   bonus crow: played, scored, back to the menu\nok   bonus crow page: no errors\nok   bonus saucer: played, scored, back to the menu\nok   bonus saucer page: no errors\nok   bonus snowball: played, scored, back to the menu\nok   bonus snowball page: no errors\nok   lodge: E.Humanoid Uncle Dub and E.Blob hound are drawn each frame\nok   lodge: Dub stands on screen\nok   lodge: the wall focus moves with the arrows\nok   lodge page: no errors\nRESULT 17 0\n=== browser-tools\nok   freeze stops the sim\nok   slow motion sets the time scale\nok   spawn buck, doe and critter at the reticle\nok   god mode prevents benching\nok   kill all\nok   infinite ammo never empties the tube\nok   bot plays cycles every skill\nok   frame rate readout toggles\nok   unlock all trophies\nok   reset save data asks first\nok   then resets\nok   copy snapshot logs JSON\nok   jump to reaches all 15 sites, trophies and bonus games\nok   dev tools: no errors\nok   the Animal Lab shows 9 animals in 7 poses\nok   animal lab: no errors\nok   the Sound Lab plays all 63 items\nok   sound lab: no errors\nok   Xbox glyphs drawn\nok   the attract mode plays all 7 clips in order and loops\nok   attract: no errors\nRESULT 21 0\n=== browser\nok   #title runs with no errors\nok   #menu runs with no errors\nok   #hunt/hollow/1 runs with no errors\nok   #hunt/bugle/2 runs with no errors\nok   #hunt/muskeg/3 runs with no errors\nok   #trophy/muskeg runs with no errors\nok   #bonus/crow runs with no errors\nok   #range runs with no errors\nok   #lodge runs with no errors\nok   #about runs with no errors\nok   #attract runs with no errors\nok   #party/2 runs with no errors\nok   #animallab runs with no errors\nok   #soundlab runs with no errors\nok   #dev runs with no errors\nok   pick: at least 90% of pixels inside a silhouette hit that animal\nok   pick: at most 10% of pixels 3 px outside hit it\nok   a pad switches prompts to PlayStation glyphs\nok   the Xbox setting shows A\nok   the mouse switches prompts to the mouse\nok   glyph page has no errors\nok   a touch-only phone shows the gate\nRESULT 22 0\n=== flow-hub\nok   connects in ghost mode with its own card\nok   ready() once, with no key press\nok   the card is up\nok   no title, no menu\nok   Enter answers ready\nok   M answers more time\nok   the countdown\nok   the timeline runs on the hub clock\nok   progress about once a second\nok   ghost updates at most 10 a second, unreliable\nok   a received ghost is kept\nok   shots are sent reliably\nok   spawns follow the hub seed\nok   time-up sends a result\nok   exactly one result\nok   the result has a score and stats\nok   leave removes the ghost\nok   end: round over, nothing more is sent\nok   no errors\nRESULT 19 0\n=== flow-misc\nok   title\nok   not before 10 s\nok   10 s idle starts the attract mode\nok   the playlist plays sites, the tables and the lodge\nok   any key returns to the title\nok   idle again: attract again\nok   a button returns to the title\nok   menu\nok   idle on the main menu starts the attract mode\nok   the pause menu lists Dev mode\nok   a deep segment loads the site\nok   dev mode opens\nok   the animal speed slider doubles a walking deer\nok   rese